So the structure is:
```
beforeEach(() => {
    // my added doMock block ends with });
    // (but this closes both doMock and beforeEach)

    root = makeTmp();  // <-- this is OUTSIDE beforeEach
    const g = globalThis as any;
    g.__piSubagenturaInteractiveRegistry?.clear?.();
    ...
});  // <-- this is a stray extra `});`
```

I need to add the `});` AFTER my `vi.doMock` block to close the doMock call only, and then the structure should be:

```
beforeEach(() => {
    vi.resetModules();
    vi.doMock("node:child_process", () => ({
        execFileSync: ...,
    }));  // <-- close doMock
    root = makeTmp();  // <-- this is INSIDE beforeEach
    ...
